/// React Native package, so a native-only app captured nothing. This
/// is the port, and it is checked frame for frame against vectors
/// generated by `sdk/core/src/replay-ring.ts` — three implementations
/// of a diff that disagree produce a replay of a screen the user
/// never saw, and the player renders a wrong frame without complaint.
///
